                                                "sense_id": "29eaa183-9578-3333-8689-68112af81bfa",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, towards the twelfth century, there come to be two weaknesses attached to this state of half-grown youth: by night somnambulism; in the daytime seeing of visions, trance, and the gift of tears."
